        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nicole Morier, Selena Gomez, Jessie, Patrick Leonard, Destinee & Paris\n- Songs: \"Rock Me In\", \"Whiplash\", \"La Isla Bonita\"\n- Topics: songwriting, Latin pop influence, musical influence\n\nFacts:\n- Nicole Morier co-wrote \"Rock Me In\" and \"Whiplash\" for Selena Gomez & the Scene with the same singer-songwriter referenced in the chunk.\n- The other song written by that singer-songwriter and Nicole Morier has a Latin pop influence.\n- \"La Isla Bonita\" by Jessie was co-written and co-produced by Jessie and Patrick Leonard.\n- The other song’s Latin pop influence is described as similar to \"La Isla Bonita.\"\n- Destinee & Paris cited the singer-songwriter as an influence.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
