        "original_id": "3d063570-8946-56f6-b581-18e11b867e32",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: Mmm Papi, La Isla Bonita, Whiplash, Rock Me In\n- People: Madonna, Patrick Leonard, Bruce Gaitsch, Selena Gomez, Destinee & Paris\n- Albums: True Blue\n- Topics: Latin pop influence, songwriting, musical influences\n\nFacts:\n- In 1986, Madonna released \"La Isla Bonita\" on her third studio album \"True Blue\".\n- In 1987, Madonna's song \"La Isla Bonita\" was noted as a Latin pop song.\n- Madonna and Patrick Leonard co-wrote and co-produced \"La Isla Bonita\", and Bruce Gaitsch contributed additional songwriting.\n- \"Mmm Papi\" is noted for having a Latin pop influence similar to Madonna's \"La Isla Bonita\".\n- Destinee & Paris wrote the songs \"Mmm Papi\", \"Rock Me In\", and \"Whiplash\".\n- Destinee & Paris were born and raised in New Jersey, later became based in Los Angeles, and cited Britney Spears, Michael Jackson, Christina Aguilera, Beyoncé, Katy Perry, Rihanna, and Gwen Stefani as influences.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "20494970-4bf8-51a1-8cb6-da88d5dd7d94",
        "text": "Page: Mmm Papi. Sentence: \"Mmm Papi\" is noted for having a Latin pop influence, similar to Madonna's \"La Isla Bonita\" (1987).\nPage: La Isla Bonita. Sentence: \"La Isla Bonita\" (English: The Beautiful Island ) is a song by American singer Madonna from her third studio album \"True Blue\" (1986).\nPage: La Isla Bonita. Sentence: She and Patrick Leonard co-wrote and co-produced the song, and Bruce Gaitsch provided additional songwriting.\nPage: Whiplash (Selena Gomez &amp; the Scene song). Sentence: Together, they wrote \"Mmm Papi\", \"Rock Me In\" and \"Whiplash\".\nPage: Destinee &amp; Paris. Sentence: Born and raised in New Jersey, now Los Angeles-based, the sisters cite their influences as Britney Spears, Michael Jackson, Christina Aguilera, Beyoncé, Katy Perry, Rihanna, and Gwen Stefani.",
